Dear Alex,

Harbourline Home & Garden invites you to tender for the automation of our new Elmbridge
fulfilment centre (38,000 m2, leased from 15 January 2027).

We sell home and garden products online: 22,000 SKUs, from seed packets to garden
furniture. Elmbridge will replace two manual warehouses and ship about 18,000 order lines
a day, rising to 45,000 in Black Friday week.

What we expect to buy:

- An AS/RS for small and medium items, with goods-to-person picking ports.
- Automated packing (carton erector and auto-bagger) and parcel sortation.
- Integration with Microsoft Dynamics 365 and the replacement of our 2009 in-house WMS.
- Installation, testing, training and hypercare.

Industry: E-commerce fulfilment (home & garden). Products: AS/RS, goods-to-person picking,
automated packing, sortation.

The kick-off call is on Monday 28 September with operations, IT and facilities.

Kind regards,
Oliver Grant
Procurement Lead, Harbourline Home & Garden
